<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Civil Engineering Calculator Suite</title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;
}

body{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0B3C5D,#328CC1);
    min-height:100vh;
}

header{
    background:#062F4F;
    color:#fff;
    padding:30px;
    text-align:center;
    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

header h1{
    font-size:38px;
    margin-bottom:10px;
}

header p{
    font-size:18px;
    opacity:.9;
}

.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:40px auto;
    padding:20px;
}

.grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));
    gap:25px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    border-radius:15px;
    padding:25px;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.15);
    transition:.3s;
    text-align:center;
}

.card:hover{
    transform:translateY(-8px);
}

.card h2{
    color:#0B3C5D;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    font-size:22px;
}

.card p{
    color:#555;
    margin-bottom:20px;
    min-height:60px;
}

.btn{
    display:inline-block;
    text-decoration:none;
    background:#0B3C5D;
    color:white;
    padding:12px 22px;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-weight:bold;
    transition:.3s;
}

.btn:hover{
    background:#145DA0;
}

footer{
    margin-top:40px;
    padding:20px;
    text-align:center;
    color:white;
    background:#062F4F;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>🏗 Civil Engineering Calculator Suite</h1>
    <p>Professional Tools for Civil Engineers, Students & Contractors</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h2>📏 BBS Calculator</h2>
<p>Bar Bending Schedule with cutting length, weight and total steel quantity.</p>
<a href="bbs.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>💰 Cost Estimation</h2>
<p>Estimate material, labour and overall project cost.</p>
<a href="cost.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🧱 Concrete Volume</h2>
<p>Calculate concrete quantity for slabs, beams, columns and footings.</p>
<a href="concrete.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>⚙ Steel Weight</h2>
<p>Calculate reinforcement steel weight from diameter and length.</p>
<a href="steel.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🧱 Brick Calculator</h2>
<p>Find the number of bricks and mortar required for masonry work.</p>
<a href="brick.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏠 Plaster Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate cement, sand and plaster quantity.</p>
<a href="plaster.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏗 PCC/RCC Calculator</h2>
<p>Estimate cement, sand and aggregate for PCC and RCC.</p>
<a href="rcc.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📐 Beam Calculator</h2>
<p>Beam reinforcement and concrete quantity calculations.</p>
<a href="beam.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏢 Column Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate reinforcement and concrete for columns.</p>
<a href="column.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏠 Slab Calculator</h2>
<p>Estimate slab concrete volume and reinforcement.</p>
<a href="slab.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📏 Unit Converter</h2>
<p>Convert Length, Area, Volume and Weight units.</p>
<a href="converter.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>💧 Water Tank Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate water tank capacity and volume.</p>
<a href="tank.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📋 BBS PDF Report</h2>
<p>Generate printable BBS reports and export as PDF.</p>
<a href="bbs-report.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📊 Material Estimation</h2>
<p>Estimate Cement, Sand, Aggregate and Steel quantities.</p>
<a href="material.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🏡 Foundation Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate excavation, footing concrete and reinforcement.</p>
<a href="foundation.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🪨 Excavation Calculator</h2>
<p>Estimate earthwork excavation and backfilling quantity.</p>
<a href="excavation.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🛣 Road Quantity Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate road layers, asphalt and sub-base quantities.</p>
<a href="road.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>🧮 Stair Calculator</h2>
<p>Calculate rise, tread, reinforcement and concrete quantity.</p>
<a href="stair.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📅 Project Planner</h2>
<p>Plan project duration, labour and execution schedule.</p>
<a href="planner.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>📈 Rate Analysis</h2>
<p>Perform detailed rate analysis for construction items.</p>
<a href="rate-analysis.html" class="btn">Open</a>
</div>

</div>

</div>

<footer>
<h3>Civil Engineering Calculator Suite</h3>
<p>Designed for Engineers, Contractors & Engineering Students</p>
<p>© 2026 All Rights Reserved</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
